    <string name="drain_how_to_use_body" formatted="false">Tap Start to begin recording battery drain.\n\nThe monitor tracks:\n  - Current draw (mA) every 5 seconds\n  - Battery level changes over time\n  - Screen on/off state correlation\n  - Drain rate per hour (5m, 15m, 30m, 1hr windows)\n  - Screen-on vs screen-off drain rates\n  - Hourly breakdown when tracking &gt;1hr\n\nLeave it running while using the device normally\nto measure real-world drain behavior.</string>
