    <string name="leak_how_to_use_body" formatted="false">Tap Start to begin monitoring all process memory.\n\nThe detector tracks RSS for every process and flags:\n  - Monotonic growth (RSS only goes up)\n  - Growth rate (KB/min)\n  - Linear correlation (how steady the growth is)\n  - Absolute growth amount\n\nConfidence levels:\n  CERTAIN — strong monotonic growth + high correlation\n  HIGH — consistent growth pattern\n  MEDIUM — noticeable growth with some noise\n  LOW — some growth but inconclusive\n\nRun for 5-10 minutes for meaningful results.\nLonger = more accurate leak detection.</string>
